## 9. Controlled manifest — Stage A reservations

`REG-D-017` permanently reserves `JAN-CSAA-000` through `JAN-CSAA-011`. Only `JAN-CSAA-000` is authored. Reservation, a planned filename, or an approved-in-principle commission does not create a document or confer authority.

| Document ID | Planned filename | Artifact state | Commission state | Current authority | Primary responsibility |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `JAN-CSAA-000` | `README.md` | `0.2.1` / Proposed / authored | Stage A carriage and W0-17 preparation authorized | None as a member; W0-17 not presented | Manifest, precedence, vocabulary, scope, closure, commission |
| `JAN-CSAA-001` | `JAN-CSAA-001 - Codebase Semantic Analysis and Assurance Architecture.md` | Unaudited and unauthored; target starts at `0.1.0` / Draft | Wave 1 approved in principle by W0-08; inactive until W0-17 | None | Context, responsibilities, trust boundaries, flows, failure and degradation |
| `JAN-CSAA-002` | `JAN-CSAA-002 - TypeScript Semantic Model and Invariant Catalog.md` | Unaudited and unauthored; target starts at `0.1.0` / Draft | Wave 1 approved in principle by W0-08; inactive until W0-17 | None | Identity, revisions, AST, symbols, types, graphs, coverage, traces, evidence |
| `JAN-CSAA-003` | `JAN-CSAA-003 - Analysis Enrichment Query and Change Impact Specification.md` | Unaudited and unauthored | Reserved; later wave not commissioned | None | Extraction, enrichment, soundness, uncertainty, deltas, impact, explanations |
| `JAN-CSAA-004` | `JAN-CSAA-004 - Code Analysis Rule Gate and Analyzer Provider Contract.md` | Unaudited and unauthored | Reserved; later wave not commissioned | None | Rule profiles, gate profiles/evaluations, Analyzer Finding Records, severity, conflicts, exceptions |
| `JAN-CSAA-005` | `JAN-CSAA-005 - JPWB TypeScript Repository Semantic Inventory and Conformance Mapping.md` | Unaudited and unauthored; target starts at `0.1.0` / Draft | Wave 1 approved in principle by W0-08; inactive until W0-17 | None | Packages, configs, architecture constraints, tools, tests, traces, unknowns |
| `JAN-CSAA-006` | `JAN-CSAA-006 - Golden Repository and Change Scenario Fixture.md` | Unaudited and unauthored | Reserved; later wave not commissioned | None | Known facts, known Analyzer Finding Records, mutations, expected deltas, runtime observations |
| `JAN-CSAA-007` | `JAN-CSAA-007 - Semantic Snapshot Graph Query Analysis Record and Adapter Contract Package.md` | Unaudited and unauthored | Reserved; later wave not commissioned | None | Schemas, APIs, errors, versions, provenance, adapters, compatibility |
| `JAN-CSAA-008` | `JAN-CSAA-008 - Executable Analyzer Invariant and Conformance Test Specification.md` | Unaudited and unauthored | Reserved; later wave not commissioned | None | Golden, property, mutation, differential, incremental, security, performance tests |
